{
  "_recipe": "API-006 Fetch activity history",
  "_contract_version": "2.1 (option B + bundled requests-table search)",
  "_notes": [
    "Trigger changes: (1) DELETE the continuation_token PATH parameter; (2) ADD continuation_token to the request BODY schema; (3) REPLACE the 200 body schema with response_200_body_schema below.",
    "NEW step (in the try, alongside the other two): workato_workflow_task.search_requests \u2014 app = MARS RC Data Collection, NO created_at filter (unwindowed on purpose: enables EVENTS_MISSING detection), limit = 200 (action maximum), Next page token input CLEARED.",
    "Step 2 find_users: continuation_token input CLEARED (users unpaginated by contract).",
    "Step 3 lookup_events: continuation_token input maps from the request BODY pill (the one true cursor).",
    "Step 4 mapping: ok=true; users <- find_users Users pill; users_truncated_token <- find_users Continuation token pill; requests <- search_requests Request list pill (flatten stage_name, nest active_task per schema, map chosen table columns into context); requests_truncated_token <- search_requests Next page token pill; activity_records <- lookup_events records pill; continuation_token <- lookup_events Continuation token pill.",
    "Step 6 mapping (500): ok=false; error_message <- catch error datapills.",
    "users[] and all embedded user objects mirror performed_by field names (user_id/user_name/user_email/status) \u2014 one vocabulary across the payload."
  ],
